DESCRIPTION:Jourdain Fisher has got it all. He is a hilarious comedian\, wr
 iter\, and actor. He has appeared on COMEDY CENTRAL\, AFTER MIDNIGHT on CBS
 \, and has made two appearances on THE TONIGHT SHOW STARRING JIMMY FALLON w
 here he received a standing ovation both times. In fact\, his first perform
 ance went so well that Jimmy hired him to be a staff writer. He has also wr
 itten for VICELAND\, NETFLIX and BET. He was a highlight at the prestigious
  Just For Laughs festival in Montreal as a New Face and was a finalist for 
 Stand Up NBC. Jourdain has also performed at numerous festivals including S
 XSW\, Moontower\, Laugh Your Asheville Off\, Laughing Skull\, and Riot Come
 dy Fest. Jourdain has gained attention on social media platforms with numer
 ous viral clips racking up millions of views on TikTok and Instagram. His d
 ebut Comedy Album “Good For You” can be found on all streaming platform
 s. When he is not touring he resides in New York City where he is a regular
  at The Comedy Cellar and Gotham Comedy Club.\n\nThere is a two-item per pe
 rson minimum in the Showroom\, which can be fulfilled with any food or drin
 k items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food and drinks purchased in the bar
  and lounge do not count towards the two-item minimum.\n\nManagement reserv
 es the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem 
 disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.a
